[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 26650.548, "timestamp": "07:24:10", "text": "不想遇到像英語噴子那樣的人，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26654.948, "timestamp": "07:24:14", "text": "或者遇到說英語的噴子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26657.03, "timestamp": "07:24:17", "text": "。你知道，我們這些人有時會變得很暴躁，他們會"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26668.03, "timestamp": "07:24:28", "text": "襲擊像日本人和中國人社區這樣的安全空間，製造混亂。為了防止這種情況發生，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26674.788, "timestamp": "07:24:34", "text": "我認為這個世界需要某種安全保障措施。這就像一個秘密代碼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26676.788, "timestamp": "07:24:36", "text": "你需要根據廣告看板上的問題猜出一個秘密問題，但我忘了密碼。雖然遇到了一些問題，但有人幫了我。他叫什麼名字？他叫什麼名字？他也沒什麼"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 26693.187, "timestamp": "07:24:53", "author": "@zergrush78319", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_nDwl-xtQg1-Z5v6Iv64Z42_Hei-15daYPmWXqoFR-4_b8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/G8AfY6yWGuKuhL0PlbiA2AE"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26695.99, "timestamp": "07:24:55", "text": "優勢。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 26696.515, "timestamp": "07:24:56", "author": "@yashchourasia2215", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mbRu2gYmpEUO4nLl0jA2optOzbTHvVFqZhza3dfpPmwg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "yaaa they actually are"}]